sp":["Artes gr\u00e1ficas","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Grafische kunst, vormgeving","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"pt":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"en":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":"The most interactive museum in Brussels\r\nFun activity to visit with family or friends","longdescr":"It's Sunday and you don't know what to do in Brussels to take your mind off things. With your friends, you have toured the different activities offered by our beautiful big city. You have already taken your friends, your spouse, your children everywhere, and they are tired of doing the same activities over and over again. You are looking for an interesting and fun outing at the same time. And all of that, of course, for a reasonable budget\u2026 Welcome to Illusion Brussels!\r\nPrepare your visit\r\n\r\nA museum with illusions you say?\r\nIllusion Brussels presents itself as a small museum of the incredible. Each element presented will seem impossible or counter-intuitive to you. Some are simple illusions, finely selected and presented with taste and sobriety. Others will be magic tricks or wizardry. And for the highlight of the show, there will be what we could call technological miracles.\r\nThings we see on the internet and which we think are faked. At Illusion Brussels, you will be able to see them with your own eyes, take photos or film them.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"it":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"cn":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"fr":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":"Le mus\u00e9e le plus interactif de Bruxelles\r\nActivit\u00e9 sympa \u00e0 visiter en famille ou entre amis\r\n","longdescr":"C\u2019est dimanche, et vous ne savez pas quoi faire \u00e0 Bruxelles pour vous changer les id\u00e9es. Avec vos amis, vous avez fait le tour des diff\u00e9rentes activit\u00e9s propos\u00e9es par notre belle grande ville. Vous avez d\u00e9j\u00e0 emmen\u00e9 vos amis, votre conjoint, vos enfants partout, et ils en ont marre de faire et refaire les m\u00eames activit\u00e9s. Vous cherchez \u00e0 faire une sortie int\u00e9ressante et amusante \u00e0 la fois. Et tout \u00e7a bien s\u00fbr, pour un budget raisonnable\u2026 Bienvenue \u00e0 Illusion Brussels !\r\nPr\u00e9parez votre visite\r\n\r\nUn mus\u00e9e avec des illusions dites-vous ?\r\nIllusion Brussels se pr\u00e9sente comme un petit mus\u00e9e de l\u2019incroyable. Chaque \u00e9l\u00e9ment pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 vous semblera impossible ou contre-intuitif. Certains sont de simples trompes-l'\u0153il finement s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s et pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s avec go\u00fbt et sobri\u00e9t\u00e9. D'autres seront des tours de magie, ou de prestidigitation. Et pour le clou du spectacle, il y aura ce qu'on pourrait appeler des miracles technologiques.\r\nDes choses qu'on peut voir sur internet en vid\u00e9o, et dont on pense qu'elles sont truqu\u00e9es, \u00e0 Illusion Brussels, vous pourrez les voir de vos yeux, et les photographier ou les filmer.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"sp":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"},"nl":{"name":"Illusion brussels Museum","shortdescr":"Het meest interactieve museum van Brussel\r\nLeuke activiteit om te doen met familie of vrienden\r\n","longdescr":"Het is zondag en je weet niet wat je in Brussel moet doen om je gedachten te verzetten. Je hebt al de verschillende activiteiten van onze mooie grote stad met je vrienden gedaan. Je hebt je vrienden, je partner, je kinderen al overal mee naartoe genomen en ze zijn het beu om steeds dezelfde activiteiten te doen. Je bent op zoek naar een interessant en leuk uitstapje. En dat alles natuurlijk voor een redelijk budget\u2026 Welkom bij Illusion Brussel!\r\nBereid je bezoek voor\r\n\r\nEen museum met illusies, zegt u?\r\nIllusion Brussel profileert zich als een klein museum van het ongelooflijke. Elk gepresenteerd element zal je onmogelijk of contra-intu\u00eftief lijken. Sommige zijn simpele illusies, fijn geselecteerd en gepresenteerd met smaak en soberheid. Anderen zullen goocheltrucs zijn of toveren. En voor het hoogtepunt van de show, zullen er zogenaamde technologische wonderen zijn.\r\nDingen die we op internet kunnen zien en waarvan we denken dat ze nep zijn. Bij Illusion Brussel kun je ze met je eigen ogen zien, ze fotograferen of filmen.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 828 16 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.527437"}},"place":{"id":277716,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Illusion Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Fromages","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 828 16 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Fromages, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Illusion Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Fromages","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 828 16 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Fromages, 22","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Illusion Brussels","address_street_name":"Kaasmarkt","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@illusionbrussels.be","website":"https:\/\/illusionbrussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 828 16 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Kaasmarkt, 22","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","descripti