hrungen in der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt organisieren.\r\nDie Mitgliedsvereine sind ARAU, Pro Velo, Brussels Chatterguides und Arkadia. Im Jahr 2020 hat sich La Fonderie als Partnerverein angeschlossen.\r\nEntdecken Sie das UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe, Jugendstilarchitektur, die Bauwerke von Victoria Horta, Gem\u00e4lde von Magritte, Comic-Kunst von Herg\u00e9, Streetart, Europa, Bier, Schokolade oder besichtigen Sie architektonische Perlen des Jugendstils, des Art-d\u00e9co oder des Neoklassizismus, die normalerweise nicht f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich sind. Die F\u00fchrungen werden sowohl f\u00fcr Einzelbesucher als auch f\u00fcr Gruppen angeboten und reichen von klassischen \u00fcber originelle bis hin zu vollkommen neuen Konzepten und Formaten. Neben Stadtf\u00fchrungen zu Fu\u00df sind auch Besichtigungen per Fahrrad, Bus oder Boot m\u00f6glich.\r\nExplore.Brussels organisiert unter anderem auch das Jugendstil- und Art-d\u00e9co-Festival BANAD, die Brussels Biennale - Neoclassic (BBN) sowie weitere Projekte, darunter die Ausbildung von Stadtf\u00fchrern, der \u201eVerein der Freunde\u201c und der \u201eVerein der Eigent\u00fcmer\u201c. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is a network of guided tour associations in Brussels. This organisation includes ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie and Korei. Events are organised in co-production with these 6 companies. Individual or group tours are available on foot, by bike, by bus and by boat.  Visitors discover UNESCO heritage, Magritte, art deco, chocolate and much more. Explore.Brussels also organises Brussels festivals and other large-scale projects.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels est un r\u00e9seau d'associations de visites guid\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles. Cet organisme regroupe notamment ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie et Korei. les \u00e9v\u00e9nements sont organis\u00e9s en coproduction avec ces 6 entreprises  Les visites individuelles ou en groupe sont disponibles \u00e0 pied, \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, en car et en bateau.  Les visiteurs partent \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du patrimoine de l'UNESCO, de Magritte, de l'art d\u00e9co, du chocolat et bien plus encore. Explore.Brussels organise \u00e9galement des festivals bruxellois et d'autres projets de grande envergure.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Brugmannlaan","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Brugmannlaan, 405","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is een netwerk van verenigingen voor geleide bezoeken in Brussel. Deze organisatie omvat ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie en Korei. De evenementen worden georganiseerd in coproductie met deze 6 bedrijven. Individuele of groepstochten zijn mogelijk te voet, per fiets, per bus en per boot.  Bezoekers ontdekken UNESCO erfgoed, Magritte, art deco, chocolade en nog veel meer. Explore.Brussels organiseert ook Brusselse festivals en andere grootschalige projecten.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":27246,"location":{"lat":50.80795462,"lon":4.34397082},"last_updated_at":"2024-05-29T15:24:29+02:00","published_at":"2017-02-27T10:05:49+01:00","is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/11c98de3111b3ada1c503138fe165f8909248cf7.jpg","width":1499,"height":1000,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":1000,"oEmbed_width":1499,"translations":{"de":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"pt":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"en":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"it":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"cn":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"fr":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"sp":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"},"nl":{"title":"H\u00f4tel Haerens","copyright":"\u00a9EB- Sophie Voituron"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2025-01-11","doors":"12:00:00","start":"12:00:00","end":"15:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arbeitsuchende"},"en":{"name":"Job seekers"},"it":{"name":"Disoccupati"},"fr":{"name":"Demandeurs d'emploi"},"sp":{"name":"Desempleados"},"nl":{"name":"Werkzoekenden"}},"value":14},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":17},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Studierende"},"en":{"name":"Students"},"it":{"name":"Studenti"},"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"sp":{"name":"Estudiantes"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"}},"value":14}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":5700004446,"date_start":"2025-01-11","date_end":"2025-01-11","date_next":"2025-01-11","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-12-09T12:07:33+01:00","published_at":"2024-12-09T11:45:17+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":313436,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"tour","ranking":1,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[253],"translations":{"de":["F\u00fchrungen durch Innenr\u00e4ume"],"pt":[null],"en":["Interior guided tours"],"it":["Visite guidate all\u2019interno"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Visites guid\u00e9es d\u2019int\u00e9rieurs"],"sp":["Visitas guiadas en espacios interiores"],"nl":["Interieur rondleidingen"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"pt":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"en":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Built between 1895 and 1897 for Edmond van Eetvelde, advisor to King Leopold II and General Secretary of the Congo Free State, this masterpiece by Victor Horta has at its centre a lightwell with a splendid stained-glass dome with delicate metal supports. Extended more than once, the resulting ensemble reflects the evolution of Victor Horta\u2019s style. The precious materials from Congo call to mind the historical ties between colonization and Art Nouveau, at one point referred to with the term \u201cCongo style\u201d. On the occasion of the year of Art Nouveau in 2023, the Art Nouveau Laboratory acquired accommodation in the van Eetvelde buildings, and the glass canopy was restored. Thus, it is the moment to rediscover this Art Nouveau jewel, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"it":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"cn":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e du Bureau & H\u00f4tel van Eetvelde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Construit entre 1895 et 1897 pour Edmond van Eetvelde, conseiller de L\u00e9opold II, secr\u00e9taire g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de l'\u00c9tat ind\u00e9pendant du Congo, ce chef-d\u2019\u0153uvre de Victor Horta s\u2019articule autour d\u2019un puits de lumi\u00e8re d\u00e9cor\u00e9 d\u2019une remarquable verri\u00e8re \u00e0 la d\u00e9licate structure m\u00e9tallique. Agrandi \u00e0 plusieurs reprises, cet h\u00f4tel de ma\u00eetre et ses extensions r\u00e9sument l'\u00e9volution du style de Victor Horta. Les mat\u00e9riaux pr\u00e9cieux en provenance du Congo rappellent par ailleurs les liens historiques entre la colonisation et l'Art nouveau, un temps d\u00e9sign\u00e9 sous le terme de \"style Congo\". A l\u2019occasion de l\u2019ann\u00e9e Art nouveau 2023, le Laboratoire Art nouveau a pris ses appartements au sein de l\u2019ensemble van Eetvelde et la verri\u00e8re a compl\u00e8tement \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9nov\u00e9e. L\u2019occasion de red\u00e9couvrir ce joyau de l\u2019Art nouveau, class\u00e9 au patrimoine mondial de l\u2019Unesco.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"sp":{"name":"Guided tour of van Eetvelde Office & Hotel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"},"nl":{"name":"Rondleiding van het van Eetvelde Kantoor & Herenhuis","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Gebouwd tussen 1895 en 1897 voor Edmond van Eetvelde, adviseur van koning Leopold II en algemeen secretaris van de Vrijstaat Congo, is dit meesterwerk van Victor Horta gecentreerd rond een lichtschacht met een prachtige glas-in-loodkoepel en verfijnde metalen steunen. Meerdere keren uitgebreid, weerspiegelt het resulterende geheel de evolutie van Victor Horta's stijl. De kostbare materialen uit Congo herinneren aan de historische banden tussen kolonisatie en Art Nouveau, die ooit werden aangeduid met de term \"Congo-stijl\". Ter gelegenheid van het jaar van de Art Nouveau in 2023 heeft het Art Nouveau Laboratorium onderdak gevonden in de Van Eetvelde-gebouwen, en de glazen overkapping is gerestaureerd. Dit is daarom het moment om dit Art Nouveau-juweel, dat op de Werelderfgoedlijst van UNESCO staat, opnieuw te ontdekken.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004446"}},"place":{"id":50000967,"translations":{"de":{"name":"H\u00f4tel van Eetvelde","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lab-an.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lab-an.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 303 48 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue Palmerston, 4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"H\u00f4tel van Eetvelde","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"in