 Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"en":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Amstel Quartet is a saxophone quartet from Amsterdam with an irreverent approach to programming and a group sound honed over its 25-year history in prestigious venues. \nThe evening's program takes you on a journey through eclectic musical landscapes, from baroque to contemporary, via film music that is sometimes joyful, sometimes melancholic.","longdescr":"Amstel Quartet is a saxophone quartet from Amsterdam with an irreverent approach to programming, and a group sound refined over the ensemble\u2019s 25-year history. Praised for their expressivity in a wide range of musical styles, their acclaimed performances and recordings highlight both the versatility of the saxophone and this ensemble\u2019s unique ability to communicate with audiences in a variety of musical languages. They have released 12 CDS.\nThe group has performed in such renowned venues as Amsterdam Concertgebouw, the Philharmonie in Luxembourg and Carnegie Hall in New York, and has also toured extensively around the world in Europe, the UK, Russia, the Middle East, China, Japan, Canada and the United States.\nThe evening's program takes you on a journey through eclectic musical landscapes, from baroque to contemporary, via film music that is sometimes joyful, sometimes melancholic.\nVitaly Vatulya, soprano sax ; Olivier Sliepen, alto sax ; Bas Apswoude, tenor sax ; Harry Cherrin, bariton sax\n","performers":"Vitaly Vatulya - soprano saxophone\nOlivier Sliepen - alto saxophone\nBas Apswoude - tenor saxophone\nHarry Cherrin - baritone saxophone","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"it":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"cn":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"fr":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Amstel Quartet est un quatuor de saxophones d\u2019Amsterdam avec une approche irr\u00e9v\u00e9rencieuse de la programmation et un son de groupe affin\u00e9 au cours de ses 25 ans d\u2019histoire dans des salles prestigieuses. Au programme de la soir\u00e9e, une randonn\u00e9e entre paysages musicaux \u00e9clectiques, allant du baroque au contemporain, en passant par des musiques de films parfois joyeuses, parfois m\u00e9lancoliques.","longdescr":"Amstel Quartet est un quatuor de saxophones d\u2019Amsterdam avec une approche irr\u00e9v\u00e9rencieuse de la programmation et un son de groupe affin\u00e9 au cours de ses 25 ans d\u2019histoire. Lou\u00e9s pour leur expressivit\u00e9 dans un large \u00e9ventail de styles musicaux, leurs performances et enregistrements acclam\u00e9s soulignent \u00e0 la fois la polyvalence du saxophone et la capacit\u00e9 unique de cet ensemble \u00e0 communiquer avec le public dans une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de langages musicaux. Ils ont sorti 12 CD.\n\nLe groupe s\u2019est produit dans des salles aussi renomm\u00e9es que le Concertgebouw d\u2019Amsterdam, la Philharmonie du Luxembourg et le Carnegie Hall de New York, et a \u00e9galement fait de nombreuses tourn\u00e9es en Europe, au Royaume-Uni, en Russie, au Moyen-Orient, en Chine, au Japon, au Canada et aux \u00c9tats-Unis.\n\nAu programme de la soir\u00e9e, une randonn\u00e9e entre paysages musicaux \u00e9clectiques, allant du baroque au contemporain, en passant par des musiques de films parfois joyeuses, parfois m\u00e9lancoliques.\n\nVitaly Vatulya, soprano sax ; Olivier Sliepen, alto sax ; Bas Apswoude, tenor sax ; Harry Cherrin, bariton sax.\n","performers":"Vitaly Vatulya - saxophone soprano\nOlivier Sliepen - saxophone alto\nBas Apswoude - saxophone t\u00e9nor\nHarry Cherrin - saxophone baryton","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"sp":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"},"nl":{"name":"Amstel Quartet by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Het Amstel Quartet is een saxofoonkwartet uit Amsterdam met een oneerbiedige benadering van programmering en een groepsgeluid dat in de loop van 25 jaar is verfijnd in prestigieuze zalen. Op het programma van deze avond staat een tocht door eclectische muzikale landschappen, vari\u00ebrend van barok tot hedendaags, via filmmuziek die soms vrolijk, soms melancholisch is.","longdescr":"Amstel Quartet is een saxofoonkwartet uit Amsterdam met een oneerbiedige benadering van programmering en een groepsgeluid dat in de 25-jarige geschiedenis van het ensemble werd op punt gezet. Geprezen om hun expressiviteit in een breed scala aan muziekstijlen, benadrukken hun veelgeprezen optredens en opnames zowel de veelzijdigheid van de saxofoon als het unieke vermogen van dit ensemble om met het publiek te communiceren in verschillende muzikale talen. Ze hebben 12 cd's uitgebracht.\nDe groep heeft opgetreden in gerenommeerde zalen als het Concertgebouw in Amsterdam, de Philharmonie in Luxemburg en Carnegie Hall in New York, en heeft ook uitgebreid getourd in Europa, het Verenigd Koninkrijk, Rusland, het Midden-Oosten, China, Japan, Canada en de Verenigde Staten.\nHet programma van de avond omvat een eclectisch scala aan muzikale landschappen, van barok tot hedendaags, via filmmuziek die soms vrolijk, soms melancholisch is.\nVitaly Vatulya, soprano sax ; Olivier Sliepen, alto sax ; Bas Apswoude, tenor sax ; Harry Cherrin, bariton sax\n","performers":"Vitaly Vatulya \u2013 sopraansaxofoon\nOlivier Sliepen \u2013 altsaxofoon\nBas Apswoude \u2013 tenorsaxofoon\nHarry Cherrin \u2013 baritonsaxofoon","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-amstel-quartet?id_evenement=6485","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005019"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-05-15T13:04:23+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276119,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue Albert Vanderkinderestraat","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@m