ands d'\u00e9toiles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccauderghem.be","email":"accueil@ccauderghem.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 660 03 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 660 03 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005048"},"it":{"name":"Les marchands d'\u00e9toiles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccauderghem.be","email":"accueil@ccauderghem.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 660 03 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 660 03 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005048"},"cn":{"name":"Les marchands d'\u00e9toiles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ccauderghem.be","email":"accueil@ccauderghem.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 660 03 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 660 03 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005048"},"fr":{"name":"Les marchands d'\u00e9toiles","shortdescr":"Juin 1942, c\u2019est soir d\u2019inventaire au d\u00e9p\u00f4t de tissus des Martineau, \u00e0 Paris.\n\nRaymond, le patron, ne r\u00e9ussit pas \u00e0 imposer son autorit\u00e9 ni \u00e0 sa fille, ni \u00e0 sa femme.","longdescr":"Juin 1942, c\u2019est soir d\u2019inventaire au d\u00e9p\u00f4t de tissus des Martineau, \u00e0 Paris.\n\nRaymond, le patron, ne r\u00e9ussit pas \u00e0 imposer son autorit\u00e9 ni \u00e0 sa fille, ni \u00e0 sa femme.\n\nIl y a aussi Joseph, son jeune employ\u00e9, dont le p\u00e8re est breton et la m\u00e8re juive.\n\nEt Louis, son plus vieil employ\u00e9, dont le nouvel ami est un collabo de la pire esp\u00e8ce.\n\nUne pi\u00e8ce tendre et \u00e9mouvante sign\u00e9e Anthony Michineau, port\u00e9e par un casting de r\u00eave.","performers":"Com\u00e9die d\u2019Anthony Michineau, avec Guillaume BOUCHEDE, Nicolas MARTINEZ, St\u00e9phanie CAILLOL, Julien CRAMPON, Anthony MICHINEAU et Axelle D