 \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"en":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"it":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"cn":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"fr":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":"Les Superluettes sont de retour ! Chaudes comme des ast\u00e9ro\u00efdes, elles vous reviennent enfin apr\u00e8s une tourn\u00e9e intersid\u00e9rale. Leur voix vous mettent sur orbite et vous invitent \u00e0 vous r\u00e9approprier votre bonheur. Pour cela, rien de mieux que de s'essayer \u00e0 la pratique des p\u00e9pites galactiques, un rituel magique qui accorde les c\u0153urs aux corps et relie les voix \u00e0 nos plus folles esp\u00e9rances !!! ","longdescr":"Les Superluettes sont de retour ! Chaudes comme des ast\u00e9ro\u00efdes, elles vous reviennent enfin apr\u00e8s une tourn\u00e9e intersid\u00e9rale. Leur voix vous mettent sur orbite et vous invitent \u00e0 vous r\u00e9approprier votre bonheur. Pour cela, rien de mieux que de s'essayer \u00e0 la pratique des p\u00e9pites galactiques, un rituel magique qui accorde les c\u0153urs aux corps et relie les voix \u00e0 nos plus folles esp\u00e9rances !!! La verte est \u00e9merveill\u00e9e d\u2019un bout de chiffon, voit la po\u00e9sie partout et comme une balle magique passe du triste \u00e0 la joie en un bond. Elle a le regard de l\u2019enfant et le d\u00e9sordre chaotique d\u2019une spontan\u00e9it\u00e9 d\u00e9brid\u00e9e.\nLa rouge ma\u00eetrise et contr\u00f4le l\u2019air qui rentre et qui sort, elle ch\u00e9rit le savoir et la perfection esth\u00e8te. Elle souffle le chaud comme le froid au gr\u00e9 des peurs et de l\u2019inconnu qui pourraient faire irruption. Pour ce 4\u00e8me \u00e9pisode de leur saga d\u2019Amour, il est question d\u2019amour propre, de confiance, de la qu\u00eate et de l\u2019expression de soi et de cette urgence de se r\u00e9approprier notre bonheur. Comment garder notre moteur int\u00e9rieur allum\u00e9 et ronronnant ? Qu\u2019est-ce qu\u2019on peut faire pour \u00ab aimer bien\/mieux \u00bb ?","performers":"Sarah Kl\u00e9n\u00e8s; G\u00e9raldine Cozier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"sp":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"},"nl":{"name":"Les Superluettes \u2013 Il est temps de rallumer les \u00e9toiles \u2013 L\u2019Amour, c\u2019est quoi au juste ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004208"}},"place":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dieses malerische Caf\u00e9-Theater, das 1994 in der N\u00e4he des alten \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\" er\u00f6ffnet wurde, \u00fcberrascht durch seine \u00fcberaus kleinen R\u00e4umlichkeiten. Doch daf\u00fcr ist das Programm ist umso \"gr\u00f6\u00dfer\". Reservierung empfohlen!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The desire to present theater amongst people; as if a performance is nothing but a conversation, in a place somewhere in between the large halls and the streets, half living room, half pub, in a warm ambiance where one can sip a glass while watching a performance. That's cafe-theater \"Le Jardin de ma Soeur\", at the edge of the ancient \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\", alongside one of the quays of the old port of Brussels where the spirit of the dock workers lingers and where one can still feel the presence of the beguines with their long black robes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Jardin de ma S\u0153ur est situ\u00e9 au coin d'une rue du pittoresque March\u00e9 aux poissons, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de l\u2019ancien Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles. On peut difficilement imaginer un nom plus familier. Pourtant, cet endroit n'a pas vol\u00e9 son nom. Vous obtenez exactement ce que vous attendez : une soir\u00e9e sans pr\u00e9tention, pleine de divertissements et de moments partag\u00e9s. Vous vous y sentez comme dans votre salon. Vous oubliez imm\u00e9diatement tous vos soucis et riez, chantez et profitez du spectacle avec les autres participants. Sp\u00e9cialement pour les amateurs de chanson fran\u00e7aise et de th\u00e9\u00e2tre.  \u202f \r\nPensez \u00e0 r\u00e9server votre place !\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Op een straathoek aan de pittoreske Vismarkt ligt Le Jardin de ma Soeur. Een familialere naam kan je haast niet bedenken. Toch heeft deze plek haar naam niet gestolen. Je krijgt exact wat je er zou verwachten: een pretentieloze avond vol vertier en gedeelde momenten. Hier waan je je in een gezellige en veilige woonkamer. Je vergeet er meteen al je zorgen en lacht, zingt en geniet met de andere aanwezigen. Vooral voor liefhebbers van het Franse chanson en verhaaltheater.    \u202f\u202f\u202f ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"terassequai","backoffice_id":596,"location":{"lat":50.8535193,"lon":4.347348},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-11-06T09:12:27+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0}