":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[10,4],"translations":{"de":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Jazz e Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Jazz y blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"pt":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"en":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":"For many years now, Joo Kraus has quite rightly been one of the renowned jazz trumpeters in our latitudes. Although Joo was not brought up with the trumpet in his cradle, it was placed next to his school book. His father already played the trumpet and taught him the first chords.","longdescr":"Catapulted into the scene at the age of 19 by winning the first prize at the national competition \"Jugend musiziert\", he gained five years of stage experience with the electro-rock band \"Kraan\". With Hellmut Hattler, Joo founded the hip-jazz duo \"Tab Two\" in the early 1990s. The rhythm section and effects already came from the computer - a pretty groundbreaking innovation at the beginning of the 90s. \"Tab Two\" played all over Europe, in Asia and the USA, produced eight albums and were one of the biggest influencers in this genre worldwide. In the 2000s, Joo Kraus increasingly wrote his own songs. He produced his album Sue\u00f1o in Havana's oldest recording studio and arranged songs by Michael Jackson into an intellectually sophisticated bow to the King of Pop. Joo Kraus - that is many decades of international stage and studio experience, countless worldwide tours, 2 Grammy nominations, the Echo Jazz as best German trumpeter and 6 German Jazz Awards in gold. And no matter if Joo performs with the Cuban pianist Omar Sosa, with Paula Morelenbaum, as a guest of Klaus Doldinger, with the SWR Big Band or with his own quintet, there is always his characteristic tone: modest and powerful, rousing joy of playing paired with sensitive attentiveness for the fellow musicians.\n\nJoo has also been active as a songwriter for many years and has already written for Tina Turner, among others. Aside from that, he arranges and composes for orchestra, big band and theater. The man from Ulm is a musician at heart, who prefers to break down genre boundaries and style labels and makes music the way he lives: free and emotional. And so he sets out from his home planet of jazz on more and more expansive journeys of discovery to play beyond any crossover orthodoxy with shooting stars from other galaxies - whether they be soul, funk, pop, hip-hop, Latin or electro. As a trumpeter and composer, Joo has opened his perception to musical styles from all over the world, but his sometimes melancholy, sometimes cheerful melodies remain one hundred percent Joo Kraus. His new album No Excuse will be released on Jazzhaus Records in September 2024. It's a mix of colours, stamp scrapbook, socio-political discourse and owns one thing in particular: good vibes! Music that is sometimes reminiscent of the rock of Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds, sometimes of the soul of the Commodores and sometimes of the psychedelic vocals of Pink Floyd. The album is a mix of genres and moods that is simply fun! The songs are diverse, exciting, experimental, far from musical convention and yet unmistakable - totally Joo Kraus! No Excuse!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"it":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"cn":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"fr":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":"Joo Kraus est, \u00e0 juste titre, l'un des trompettistes de jazz les plus r\u00e9put\u00e9s de notre r\u00e9gion depuis de nombreuses ann\u00e9es. Bien que Joo n'ait pas \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec une trompette dans son berceau, celle-ci \u00e9tait plac\u00e9e \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de son livre d'\u00e9cole. Son p\u00e8re jouait d\u00e9j\u00e0 de la trompette et lui a appris les premiers accords.","longdescr":"Propuls\u00e9 sur la sc\u00e8ne \u00e0 l'\u00e2ge de 19 ans en remportant le premier prix du concours national \u00ab Jugend musiziert \u00bb, il a acquis cinq ans d'exp\u00e9rience de la sc\u00e8ne avec le groupe \u00e9lectro-rock \u00ab Kraan \u00bb. Avec Hellmut Hattler, Joo a fond\u00e9 le duo hip-jazz \u00ab Tab Two \u00bb au d\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 1990. La section rythmique et les effets provenaient d\u00e9j\u00e0 de l'ordinateur - une innovation assez r\u00e9volutionnaire au d\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 90. \u00ab Tab Two a jou\u00e9 dans toute l'Europe, en Asie et aux \u00c9tats-Unis, a produit huit albums et a \u00e9t\u00e9 l'un des plus grands influenceurs du genre dans le monde entier. Dans les ann\u00e9es 2000, Joo Kraus \u00e9crit de plus en plus ses propres chansons. Il a produit son album Sue\u00f1o dans le plus ancien studio d'enregistrement de La Havane et a arrang\u00e9 des chansons de Michael Jackson pour rendre un hommage intellectuellement sophistiqu\u00e9 au roi de la pop. Joo Kraus - c'est plusieurs d\u00e9cennies d'exp\u00e9rience internationale sur sc\u00e8ne et en studio, d'innombrables tourn\u00e9es dans le monde entier, deux nominations aux Grammy Awards, l'Echo Jazz en tant que meilleur trompettiste allemand et six German Jazz Awards en or. Et que Joo se produise avec le pianiste cubain Omar Sosa, avec Paula Morelenbaum, en tant qu'invit\u00e9 de Klaus Doldinger, avec le SWR Big Band ou avec son propre quintette, on retrouve toujours son timbre caract\u00e9ristique : modeste et puissant, une joie de jouer enthousiasmante alli\u00e9e \u00e0 une attention sensible pour les autres musiciens.\n\n\nJoo est \u00e9galement actif en tant qu'auteur-compositeur depuis de nombreuses ann\u00e9es et a d\u00e9j\u00e0 \u00e9crit pour Tina Turner, entre autres. Par ailleurs, il arrange et compose pour orchestre, big band et th\u00e9\u00e2tre. Cet homme originaire d'Ulm est un musicien dans l'\u00e2me, qui pr\u00e9f\u00e8re s'affranchir des fronti\u00e8res entre les genres et des \u00e9tiquettes de style et qui fait de la musique comme il vit : libre et \u00e9motif. C'est ainsi qu'il quitte sa plan\u00e8te jazz pour des voyages de d\u00e9couverte de plus en plus vastes, afin de jouer au-del\u00e0 de toute orthodoxie crois\u00e9e avec des \u00e9toiles filantes d'autres galaxies - qu'il s'agisse de soul, de funk, de pop, de hip-hop, de musique latine ou d'\u00e9lectro. En tant que trompettiste et compositeur, Joo a ouvert sa perception aux styles musicaux du monde entier, mais ses m\u00e9lodies tant\u00f4t m\u00e9lancoliques, tant\u00f4t joyeuses, restent \u00e0 cent pour cent Joo Kraus. Son nouvel album No Excuse sortira sur le label Jazzhaus Records en septembre 2024. Il s'agit d'un m\u00e9lange de couleurs, d'un album de timbres, d'un discours sociopolitique et d'une chose en particulier : de bonnes vibrations ! Une musique qui rappelle tant\u00f4t le rock de Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds, tant\u00f4t la soul des Commodores, tant\u00f4t les voix psych\u00e9d\u00e9liques de Pink Floyd. L'album est un m\u00e9lange de genres et d'ambiances qui est tout simplement amusant ! Les chansons sont diverses, excitantes, exp\u00e9rimentales, loin des conventions musicales et pourtant incomparables - totalement Joo Kraus ! No Excuse !","performers":"Joo Krause, Trompette","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"sp":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"},"nl":{"name":"\"No Excuse\"","shortdescr":"Joo Kraus is al vele jaren met recht een van de gerenommeerde jazztrompettisten in onze contreien. Hoewel Joo niet werd opgevoed met de trompet in zijn wieg, werd deze naast zijn schoolboek gelegd. Zijn vader speelde al trompet en leerde hem de eerste akkoorden.\n","longdescr":"Toen hij op 19-jarige leeftijd de eerste prijs won bij de nationale wedstrijd \u201cJugend musiziert\u201d, deed hij vijf jaar podiumervaring op met de electro-rockband \u201cKraan\u201d. Samen met Hellmut Hattler richtte Joo begin jaren '90 het hip-jazz duo \u201cTab Two\u201d op. De ritmesectie en effecten kwamen al uit de computer - een behoorlijk baanbrekende innovatie aan het begin van de jaren 90. \u201cTab Two\u201d speelde in heel Europa, Azi\u00eb en de VS, produceerde acht albums en was wereldwijd een van de grootste be\u00efnvloeders in dit genre. In de jaren 2000 schreef Joo Kraus steeds meer eigen nummers. Hij produceerde zijn album Sue\u00f1o in de oudste opnamestudio van Havana en bewerkte nummers van Michael Jackson tot een intellectueel verfijnde buiging voor de King of Pop. Joo Kraus - dat is vele tientallen jaren internationale podium- en studio-ervaring, ontelbare wereldwijde tournees, 2 Grammy-nominaties, de Echo Jazz als beste Duitse trompettist en 6 German Jazz Awards in goud. En of Joo nu optreedt met de Cubaanse pianist Omar Sosa, met Paula Morelenbaum, als gast van Klaus Doldinger, met de SWR Big Band of met zijn eigen kwintet, altijd is er zijn karakteristieke toon: bescheiden en krachtig, opzwepende spelvreugde gepaard met gevoelige aandacht voor de medemuzikanten.\nJoo is ook al vele jaren actief als songwriter en schreef onder andere al voor Tina Turner. Daarnaast arrangeert en componeert hij voor orkest, bigband en theater. De man uit Ulm is een muzikant in hart en nieren, die het liefst genregrenzen en stijllabels doorbreekt en muziek maakt zoals hij leeft: vrij en emotioneel. En dus vertrekt hij van zijn thuisplaneet van de jazz op steeds expansievere ontdekkingsreizen om voorbij elke crossover orthodoxie te spelen met vallende sterren van andere sterrenstelsels - of het nu soul, funk, pop, hiphop, latin of elektro is. Als trompettist en componist heeft Joo zijn perceptie opengesteld voor muziekstijlen van over de hele wereld, maar zijn soms melancholische, soms vrolijke melodie\u00ebn blijven honderd procent Joo Kraus. Zijn nieuwe album No Excuse verschijnt in september 2024 op Jazzhaus Records. Het is een mix van kleuren, postzegelplakboek, sociaal-politiek discours en bezit \u00e9\u00e9n ding in het bijzonder: good vibes! Muziek die soms doet denken aan de rock van Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds, soms aan de soul van de Commodores en soms aan de psychedelische zang van Pink Floyd. Het album is een mix van genres en stemmingen die gewoon leuk is! De nummers zijn divers, spannend, experimenteel, ver van muzikale conventies en toch onmiskenbaar - helemaal Joo Kraus! Geen excuus!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005032"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39109,"location":{"lat":50.86391031,"lon":4.34697026},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-30T15:45:30+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-15T20:19:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"http