n Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"pt":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"en":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"it":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"cn":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"fr":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Une visite exclusive en compagnie de Stefaan Hautekeete, sp\u00e9cialiste du dessin ancien, conservateur aux MRBAB.\n\nDeux si\u00e8cles de l\u2019art du dessin prennent vie dans cette \u00e9tonnante s\u00e9lection de pr\u00e8s d\u2019une centaine d\u2019\u0153uvres repr\u00e9sentant les styles et les techniques les plus divers, depuis les projets d\u2019estampes de Pieter Bruegel, minutieux et pr\u00e9cis, jusqu\u2019aux esquisses extraordinairement personnelles o\u00f9 Rubens note ses id\u00e9es d\u2019une main tourbillonnante. Des sc\u00e8nes pleines d\u2019imagination tir\u00e9es de la mythologie ou de la Bible, des paysages habilement construits et des \u00e9tudes spontan\u00e9es, dessin\u00e9es sur le vif, compl\u00e8tent cet ensemble d\u2019une \u00e9blouissante vari\u00e9t\u00e9.","performers":"Stefaan Hautekeete a \u00e9tudi\u00e9 l'histoire de l'art \u00e0 l\u2019Universit\u00e9 de Groningen (Pays-Bas) et y a soutenu une th\u00e8se de doctorat consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 Hans Bol (1534-1593).  Il est actuellement conservateur aux Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles (MRBAB) o\u00f9 il dirige le Cabinet des dessins, d\u00e9partement d'art ancien.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"sp":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"},"nl":{"name":"Meet the curator - avec Stefaan Hautekeete","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/01\/24\/meet-the-curator-fr-1","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013263"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_