,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"pt":{"name":"Festival Hahalles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"en":{"name":"Hahalles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"it":{"name":"Festival Hahalles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"cn":{"name":"Festival Hahalles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"fr":{"name":"Festival Hahalles","shortdescr":"Le festival Hahalles revient en force en 2025 ! C'est \u00e0 nouveau Dena Vahdani, c\u00e9l\u00e8bre humoriste queer belgo-iranienne, qui prend le r\u00f4le de curatrice. ","longdescr":"Elle nous a concoct\u00e9 une programmation haute en couleur : Lolla Wesh, Lisa Delmoitiez, Camille Lorente ou encore Laur\u00e8ne Marx viennent jouer leur spectacle. Si vous avez d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu Dena, ou si vous n'en avez pas encore eu l'occasion, elle vient aussi nous pr\u00e9senter sa toute nouvelle heure de blagues ! Vous l'avez compris, des spectacles dr\u00f4les et puissants, touchants et subversifs, bref, de quoi passer un excellent festival !\n\nCette ann\u00e9e, en exclusivit\u00e9, des ateliers de stand-up seront organis\u00e9s par l\u2019Atout Comedy, pour celleux qui souhaitent se lancer. Pour cl\u00f4turer le tout, un gala final m\u00e9langeant stand-up et drag show, o\u00f9 l'inclusion et la diversit\u00e9 seront mis \u00e0 l'honneur.\n\n-------\n\nJeudi 9 janvier\n> 19:00 - 60' : 1 heure avec Dena\n> 21:00 - 60' : Remontada - Lisa Delmoitiez\n\nVendredi 10 janvier\n> 16:00 - 180': Atelier Atout Comedy\n> 19h - 60' : En rodage - Camille Lorente\n> 21h - 60' : Un temps sois peu - Laurene Marx\n\nSamedi 11 janvier\n> 10:00 (> 18:00) :  Atelier Atout Comedy\n> 19h - 60' : Folle furieuse - Lolla Wesh\n> 21:00 - 60' : Gala Cl\u00f4ture","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"sp":{"name":"Festival Hahalles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"},"nl":{"name":"Hahalles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.halles.be\/fr\/ag\/1714-hahalles","email":"info@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003626"}},"place":{"id":393,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek haben sich Unabh\u00e4ngigkeit und Unkonventionalit\u00e4t auf die Fahnen geschrieben. Untergebracht ist dieser hohe Ort der Kultur in einer fantastisch renovierten Glas- und Metallstruktur aus dem Jahr 1901. Auf dem Programm stehen k\u00fcnstlerische und menschliche Abenteuer und Projekte abseits der Norm...\r\n\r\nHier werden immer wieder neue Formen der B\u00fchnenkunst erfunden, die \u00fcber die klassische Partition zwischen Kunst- und Theaterschaffenden auf der einen Seite und dem Publikum auf der anderen Seite hinausgehen. \r\n\r\nAuf dem Programm - zwischen dem Stadtviertel und der weiten Welt - steht nicht weniger und nicht mehr als das Beste eines Europas, das unabl\u00e4ssig auf der Suche nach seiner Zukunft ist - Erforschung neuer Leidenschaften, Vernunft auf der Suche nach dem Abenteuer, gr\u00f6\u00dfte stilistische Freiheit... Das alles mit Darbietungen, die aus dem Rahmen fallen, und Eigenproduktionen, die unter anderem von den vier Truppen der Halles de Schaerbeek auf die Beine gestellt werden.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles showcase their independence right in the heart of Brussels, the European capital, in a metal and glass structure dating back to 1901, which has been saved from destruction and wonderfully renovated. Its space is unrivalled and perfectly suited for celebrations, extraordinary projects, as well as both artistic and human adventures. Ever since their beginnings, Les Halles have captured and crystallised movements stemming right from the edges of art and society, in an unprecedented alliance of both learned and popular culture. \r\n\r\nIt is an ideal space to create new performative formats, going beyond the classic partition between creators and spectators. Unconcerned with the barriers separating disciplines, willing to shake up the norms, Les Halles resonate with a desire for participation and involvment, be it individually or collectively, thus characterising the digital age. \r\n\r\nOpen to contemporary hopes and upheavals spanning from the neighbourhood right out to the world at large, Les Halles keep on looking for what Europe, still on a quest for its own destiny, has to offer: exploration of new passions, reason seeking out adventure, the utmost freedom of style.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Lieu intemporel, Les Halles abritent leur ind\u00e9pendance au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, capitale de l\u2019Europe, dans une structure de m\u00e9tal et de verre datant de 1901 et superbement r\u00e9nov\u00e9e.\nSes volumes sans \u00e9quivalent invitent aux f\u00eates, aux projets hors normes, aux aventures artistiques et humaines : depuis l\u2019origine, les Halles captent et cristallisent les mouvements de fond de l\u2019art et de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9, dans une alliance in\u00e9dite du savant et du populaire.\n\nElles offrent un espace id\u00e9al pour r\u00e9inventer les formes du spectacle, au-del\u00e0 de la classique partition entre cr\u00e9ateurs d\u2019un c\u00f4t\u00e9 et spectateurs de l\u2019autre. Bousculant les usages, Les Halles r\u00e9sonnent avec l\u2019envie de participation et d\u2019engagement, \u00e9gotiste ou collectif, qui caract\u00e9rise l\u2019\u00e9poque num\u00e9rique.\n\nOuvertes aux espoirs et aux bouleversements contemporains, du quartier jusqu\u2019au grand large du monde, elles cherchent \u00e0 retrouver le meilleur d\u2019une Europe toujours en qu\u00eate de son destin : l\u2019exploration de passions nouvelles,  la raison cherchant l\u2019aventure, la plus grande libert\u00e9 d\u2019allure.\n\n A c\u00f4t\u00e9 d\u2019une programmation traditionnelle, les Halles d\u00e9veloppent des temps atypiques sur de grands week-ends et engagent des projets qui sortent du champ strict du spectacle vivant. Les Halles, d\u2019autre part, lancent des productions propres, notamment avec les quatre compagnies associ\u00e9es au lieu.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles exhibe su independencia en el coraz\u00f3n de Bruselas, la capital europea, en una estructura de metal y vidrio que data de 1901, que se salv\u00f3 de la destrucci\u00f3n y se renov\u00f3 maravillosamente. Su espacio es incomparable y se adapta perfectamente a celebraciones, proyectos extraordinarios y aventuras tanto art\u00edsticas como humanas. Desde sus inicios, el centro Les Halles ha capturado y cristalizado movimientos provenientes de los l\u00edmites del arte y la sociedad, en una alianza sin precedentes de cultura tanto erudita como popular. \r\nEs un espacio ideal para crear nuevos formatos performativos, yendo m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de la partici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica entre creadores y espectadores. Sin preocuparse por las barreras que separan las disciplinas, dispuesta a sacudir las normas, Les Halles resuena con un deseo de participaci\u00f3n e implicaci\u00f3n, ya sea de manera individual o colectiva, caracterizando as\u00ed la era digital.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallen van Schaarbeek","address_street_name":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Les Halles werken aan een multidisciplinair, hedendaags en internationaal artistiek project dat deze instelling een bijzondere plaats geeft binnen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne in Brussel.\r\nLes Halles vormen een buitengewone culturele plek, zowel door de ruimtes als door de artistieke voorstellen.die een kruising zijn tussen dans, circus, podiumkunsten en muzikale optredens. \r\n\r\nLes Halles dragen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne een warm hart toe. Les Halles proberen zinvolle, artistiek vernieuwende projecten tot stand te brengen. In die zin wordt de kunstenaars de mogelijkheid geboden hun tijd te nemen, te experimenteren en te zoeken.\r\n\r\nLes Halles slaan een brug tussen een communautair engagement en de creatieve sc\u00e8ne op Europees niveau. Ze spelen een essenti\u00eble rol in de confrontatie van verschillende culturen, talen en benaderingen in Brussel. De aanwezigheid van Europese projecten is een van de draagvlakken van les halles. Zowel voor de toeschouwers als voor de kunstenaars van bij ons pogen les Halles de Brusselse sc\u00e8ne open te trekken en het publiek kennis te laten maken met vernieuwende, artistieke bewegingen die zich elders hebben ontwikkeld.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":106,"location":{"lat":50.85994245,"lon":4.36947808},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-10-10T09:49:00+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:17+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":393,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek haben sich Unabh\u00e4ngigkeit und Unkonventionalit\u00e4t auf die Fahnen geschrieben. Untergebracht ist dieser hohe Ort der Kultur in einer fantastisch renovierten Glas- und Metallstruktur aus dem Jahr 1901. Auf dem Programm stehen k\u00fcnstlerische und menschliche Abenteuer und Projekte abseits der Norm...\r\n\r\nHier werden immer wieder neue Formen der B\u00fchnenkunst erfunden, die \u00fcber die klassische Partition zwischen Kunst- und Theaterschaffenden auf der einen Seite und dem Publikum auf der anderen Seite hinausgehen. \r\n\r\nAuf dem Programm - zwischen dem Stadtviertel und der weiten Welt - steht nicht weniger und nicht mehr als das Beste eines Europas, das unabl\u00e4ssig auf der Suche nach seiner Zukunft ist - Erforschung neuer Leidenschaften, Vernunft auf der Suche nach dem Abenteuer, gr\u00f6\u00dfte stilistische Freiheit... Das alles mit Darbietungen, die aus dem Rahmen fallen, und Eigenproduktionen, die unter anderem von den vier Truppen der Halles de Schaerbeek auf die Beine gestellt werden.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles showcase their independence right in the heart of Brussels, the European capital, in a metal and glass structure dating back to 1901, which has been saved from destruction and wonderfully renovated. Its space is unrivalled and perfectly suited for celebrations, extraordinary projects, as well as both artistic and human adventures. Ever since their beginnings, Les Halles have captured and crystallised movements stemming right from the edges of art and society, in an unprecedented alliance of both learned and popular culture. \r\n\r\nIt is an ideal space to create new performative formats, going beyond the classic partition between creators and spectators. Unconcerned with the barriers separating disciplines, willing to shake up the norms, Les Halles resonate with a desire for participation and involvment, be it individually or collectively, thus characterising the digital age. \r\n\r\nOpen to contemporary hopes and upheavals spanning from the neighbourhood right out to the world at large, Les Halles keep on looking for what Europe, still on a quest for its own destiny, has to offer: exploration of new passions, reason seeking out adventure, the utmost freedom of style.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Lieu intemporel, Les Halles abritent leur ind\u00e9pendance au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, capitale de l\u2019Europe, dans une structure de m\u00e9tal et de verre datant de 1901 et superbement r\u00e9nov\u00e9e.\nSes volumes sans \u00e9quivalent invitent aux f\u00eates, aux projets hors normes, aux aventures artistiques et humaines : depuis l\u2019origine, les Halles captent et cristallisent les mouvements de fond de l\u2019art et de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9, dans une alliance in\u00e9dite du savant et du populaire.\n\nElles offrent un espace id\u00e9al pour r\u00e9inventer les formes du spectacle, au-del\u00e0 de la classique partition entre cr\u00e9ateurs d\u2019un c\u00f4t\u00e9 et spectateurs de l\u2019autre. Bousculant les usages, Les Halles r\u00e9sonnent avec l\u2019envie de participation et d\u2019engagement, \u00e9gotiste ou collectif, qui caract\u00e9rise l\u2019\u00e9poque num\u00e9rique.\n\nOuvertes aux espoirs et aux bouleversements contemporains, du quartier jusqu\u2019au grand large du monde, elles cherchent \u00e0 retrouver le meilleur d\u2019une Europe toujours en qu\u00eate de son destin : l\u2019exploration de passions nouvelles,  la raison cherchant l\u2019aventure, la plus grande libert\u00e9 d\u2019allure.\n\n A c\u00f4t\u00e9 d\u2019une programmation traditionnelle, les Halles d\u00e9veloppent des temps atypiques sur de grands week-ends et engagent des projets qui sortent du champ strict du spectacle vivant. Les Halles, d\u2019autre part, lancent des productions propres, notamment avec les quatre compagnies associ\u00e9es au lieu.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles exhibe su independencia en el coraz\u00f3n de Bruselas, la capital europea, en una estructura de metal y vidrio que data de 1901, que se salv\u00f3 de la destrucci\u00f3n y se renov\u00f3 maravillosamente. Su espacio es incomparable y se adapta perfectamente a celebraciones, proyectos extraordinarios y aventuras tanto art\u00edsticas como humanas. Desde sus inicios, el centro Les Halles ha capturado y cristalizado movimientos provenientes de los l\u00edmites del arte y la sociedad, en una alianza sin precedentes de cultura tanto erudita como popular. \r\nEs un espacio ideal para crear nuevos formatos performativos, yendo m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de la partici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica entre creadores y espectadores. Sin preocuparse por las barreras que separan las disciplinas, dispuesta a sacudir las normas, Les Halles resuena con un deseo de participaci\u00f3n e implicaci\u00f3n, ya sea de manera individual o colectiva, caracterizando as\u00ed la era digital.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallen van Schaarbeek","address_street_name":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Les Halles werken aan een multidisciplinair, hedendaags en internationaal artistiek project dat deze instelling een bijzondere plaats geeft binnen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne in Brussel.\r\nLes Halles vormen een buitengewone culturele plek, zowel door de ruimtes als door de artistieke voorstellen.die een kruising zijn tussen dans, circus, podiumkunsten en muzikale optredens. \r\n\r\nLes Halles dragen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne een warm hart toe. Les Halles proberen zinvolle, artistiek vernieuwende projecten tot stand te brengen. In die zin wordt de kunstenaars de mogelijkheid geboden hun tijd te nemen, te experimenteren en te zoeken.\r\n\r\nLes Halles slaan een brug tussen een communautair engagement en de creatieve sc\u00e8ne op Europees niveau. Ze spelen een essenti\u00eble rol in de confrontatie van verschillende culturen, talen en benaderingen in Brussel. De aanwezigheid van Europese projecten is een van de draagvlakken van les halles. Zowel voor de toeschouwers als voor de kunstenaars van bij ons pogen les Halles de Brusselse sc\u00e8ne open te trekken en het publiek kennis te laten maken met vernieuwende, artistieke bewegingen die zich elders hebben ontwikkeld.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":106,"location":{"lat":50.85994245,"lon":4.36947808},"last_updated_at":"2024-10-10T09:49:00+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:17+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/aa75743f8fc22ff8f44001bd9b0bcd22f3730994.JPG","width":1018,"height":683,"ratio":1.49,"oEmbed_height":683,"oEmbed_width":1018,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Festival Hahalles","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2025-01-09","doors":null,"start":"00:00:00","end":null,"end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2025-01-10","doors":null,"start":"00:00:00","end":null,"end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2025-01-11","doors":null,"start":"00:00:00","end":null,"end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[574331,574332,574336,574334,574335,574337,574338],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"visit_profile":{"list":[332,337],"translations":{"de":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"],"it":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"],"sp":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"],"nl":["LGBTQIA+","Highlight"]}},"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["major_event"]},{"id":50012035,"date_start":"2025-01-09","date_end":"2025-01-15","date_next":"2025-01-09","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-10-31T15:22:03+01:00","published_at":"2024-07-01T11:24:53+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":303267,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":0.9499142515929965,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"points de rupture | Fran\u00e7oise BLOCH","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"pt":{"name":"points de rupture | Fran\u00e7oise BLOCH","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"en":{"name":"Points de rupture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"it":{"name":"points de rupture | Fran\u00e7oise BLOCH","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"cn":{"name":"points de rupture | Fran\u00e7oise BLOCH","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"fr":{"name":"Points de rupture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Plong\u00e9e dans une casserole d\u2019eau, la grenouille cuit lentement,\nberc\u00e9e par la douce chaleur. Elle finit par s\u2019endormir et meurt.\nOr, immerg\u00e9e dans l\u2019eau bouillante, elle aurait pris la fuite,\nsauvant sa peau d\u2019une mort certaine.\n\n\u00c0 l\u2019aune de cette petite fable de la grenouille, qu\u2019en est-il de l\u2019homme ou d\u2019une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 ? Apr\u00e8s une trilogie sur la m\u00e9canique du profit et une conf\u00e9rence d\u00e9cal\u00e9e sur l\u2019impuissance du politique face au secteur financier, Zoo Th\u00e9\u00e2tre poursuit son travail d\u2019\u00e9criture sc\u00e9nique et de conscientisation rafra\u00eechissante.\n\nCr\u00e9\u00e9 au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National en 2020, Points de rupture \u2013 et sa force de tir -, nous revient aujourd\u2019hui dans un monde aux impasses de plus en plus criantes, l\u2019\u00e9cologique comme la sociale, explorant ces moments o\u00f9 un \u00eatre humain rompt avec le syst\u00e8me dans lequel il est inscrit, afin de tracer une autre ligne. Burn-out, r\u00e9volte, crise, profond d\u00e9saccord\u2026 Le spectacle interroge l\u2019oppression qui pr\u00e9c\u00e8de, voire qui d\u00e9clenche ces mutations. Et face aux dangers imminents, restons-nous immobiles, endormi\u2219e\u2219s dans l\u2019eau chaude ? Ou cette immobilit\u00e9 est-elle un effet d\u2019optique ?\n\nSans jamais donner de r\u00e9ponses toutes faites, \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un voyage \u00e0 travers une question, Points de rupture articule textes fictifs, mat\u00e9riaux documentaires, improvisations d\u2019acteur\u2219ice\u2219s et contrepoints vid\u00e9o. La fuite, le corps qui l\u00e2che ou le cri \u00ab \u00e7a suffit ! \u00bb font le vide et c\u2019est dans l\u2019espace de l\u2019humour et de la fantaisie, que le spectacle pose les premi\u00e8res pierres d\u2019un \u00ab autrement \u00bb possible\u2026 Ne sommes-nous pas en effet travers\u00e9\u2219e\u2219s de sursauts permanents o\u00f9 nous cherchons le moyen de sortir de nos casseroles ? Peut-\u00eatre m\u00eame que l\u2019on se pr\u00e9pare au grand saut ?\n\nQuand nous repoussons l\u2019\u00e9ch\u00e9ance, quelles limites s\u2019atteignent, quels d\u00e9clics surgissent, parfois in extremis, quel imaginaire grandit au fond de nos cervelles et nourrit la possibilit\u00e9 d\u2019autres issues et d\u2019autres \u00e9critures ?\nCar enfin, nous ne sommes pas des grenouilles et d\u2019autres fables sont possibles.","performers":"texte Elena Doratiotto & COLLECTIF\njeu Elena Doratiotto, Jules Puibaraud, Aymeric Trionfo, Aloula Watel\nfaussaires shakespeariens Fran\u00e7oise Bloch, Jules Puibaraud, Olivier Saccomano\ndirection technique, constructions & r\u00e9gie plateau Marc Defrise\nr\u00e9gie g\u00e9n\u00e9rale \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation C\u00e9dric Otte\nproduction Daria Bubalo & Boris Rachel Goldenberg\nmise en sc\u00e8ne Fran\u00e7oise Bloch","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"sp":{"name":"points de rupture | Fran\u00e7oise BLOCH","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"},"nl":{"name":"Points de rupture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatre-martyrs.be\/spectacles\/points-de-rupture\/","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012035"}},"place":{"id":231711,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/