null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/19\/workshop-expo-bilingue-pour-enfants-fr-n-18","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013086"},"fr":{"name":"Drafts : Workshop Expo bilingue pour enfants","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Visite guid\u00e9e et workshop pour les 6-12 ans par Jennifer Batla\n\nPar o\u00f9 commencer ? Un dessin, une \u00e9bauche, une esquisse, un croquis ? Qu\u2019est-ce qui pr\u00e9c\u00e8de la r\u00e9alisation d\u2019une \u0153uvre d\u2019art ? Comment croquer la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 sur le vif ou dans l\u2019atelier ? Quel d\u00e9tail compte ? \n\nUne visite originale qui invite \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir l\u2019esquisse dans tous ses \u00e9tats et, crayon \u00e0 la main, \u00e0 \u2018croquer\u2019 le mus\u00e9e, ses espaces, ses visiteurs ou ses \u0153uvres !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/19\/workshop-expo-bilingue-pour-enfants-fr-n-18","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013086"},"sp":{"name":"Drafts : Workshop Expo bilingue pour enfants","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/19\/workshop-expo-bilingue-pour-enfants-fr-n-18","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013086"},"nl":{"name":"Drafts : Tweetalige Expo Workshop voor kinderen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Tweetalige rondleiding met workshop voor 6- tot 12-jarigen door Jennifer Batla\n\nWaarmee beginnen? Een tekening, een schets, een eerste aanzet, een ontwerp? Wat gaat vooraf aan een uitgewerkt kunstwerk? Hoe vat je de werkelijkheid ter plaatse of in het atelier? Welk detail is belangrijk?\n\nDeze originele rondleiding nodigt je uit om de schets in al zijn vormen te ontdekken. Met het potlood in de hand \u2018ontwerp\u2019 je zelf het museum, zijn ruimtes, zijn bezoekers en zijn werken!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/nl\/agenda\/2024\/10\/19\/tweetalige-expo-workshop-voor-kinderen-n-14","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013086"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_