36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"en":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":"AMOROSA is a multicultural music group based in Brussels, driven by a voice that sings of love in French and Portuguese and draws us into its poetry, between the warmth of Brazilian rhythms and the elegance of jazz harmonies. The voice is that of singer-songwriter St\u00e9phanie Scultore.","longdescr":"After Chorando Sim, a samba-flavoured debut album, and the children's project Gato, AMOROSA will be presenting Petit Soleil, an album written mainly in French that draws on the traditional rhythms of north-east Brazil to tell us about the cycle of life through stories, tales, legends and poems that, from sunrise to sunset, interweave and echo each other like memories stuck together in a family album. Amorosa is a unique group that mixes genres and takes the audience into a universe that is at times intimate, festive or contemplative, inviting us to introspect, to celebrate joy and to let go of sorrow. Amorosa's music is generous, simple, elegant and rich, and it draws its uniqueness and modernity from the way it blends genres, textures and registers while drawing on popular traditions. The musicians have all lived, travelled or studied in Brazil, and draw on the country's musical roots to create a dialogue with jazz, poetry and the French language, creating a hybrid music that is powerful, refined and full of freedom. \nOn stage, the group is full of sunshine, \u2018not hesitating to mix rhythms, to mix colours, to dare to take less well-trodden paths... and in this almost dreamlike universe, a little cosy and cottony, Petit Soleil is quite simply a great joy\u2019 (Jacques Prouvot for Jazzques magazine). \u2018Love has its reasons that reason ignores\u2019 goes the saying... So to try and pigeonhole Amorosa's music would be to miss out on its richness, its joy, its sweetness and its madness, and to miss out on the ever-changing journey the group takes us on. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"it":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"cn":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"fr":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":"AMOROSA est un groupe de musique multiculturel bas\u00e9 \u00e0 Bruxelles port\u00e9 par une voix qui chante l\u2019 amour en fran\u00e7ais et en portugais et nous entraine dans sa po\u00e9sie, entre la chaleur des rythmes br\u00e9siliens et l\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gance des harmonies du jazz. Cette voix c\u2019est celle de la chanteuse, autrice-compositrice St\u00e9phanie Scultore.","longdescr":"Corps et \u00e2me du projet, elle vit \u00e0 Bruxelles depuis plus d\u2019une dizaine d\u2019ann\u00e9es. Son h\u00e9ritage musical m\u00e9tiss\u00e9, entre les grands chanteurs \u00e0 texte de la chanson fran\u00e7aise, le jazz, les musiques latines et le flamenco la m\u00e8ne au Br\u00e9sil dont elle embrasse la musique et la culture. AMOROSA, c\u2019est aussi le fruit de sa rencontre (\u00e0 la ville comme \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne) avec le guitariste de jazz, musique br\u00e9silienne et compositeur, Matteo Carola. Ils se rencontrent entre deux voyages \u00e0 Rio de Janeiro et forment ensemble le c\u0153ur d\u2019AMOROSA. C\u2019est principalement \u00e0 deux qu\u2019ils cr\u00e9ent les morceaux: il compose des chansons qu'elle \u00e9crit, elle \u00e9crit et compose des chansons qu\u2019il arrange, ils se compl\u00e8tent et inventent ensemble. Se joignent \u00e0 eux leur complice de longue date Mathieu Robert au saxophone soprano (Robert\/Ganau duo), le contrebassiste br\u00e9silien Fil Caporali (Commander spoon, Synestet) et Falk Shrauwen, aux percussions (Sylvie Kreush, Echos of the zoo). Apr\u00e8s Chorando Sim, un premier album tr\u00e8s samba et le projet jeune public Gato, AMOROSA nous pr\u00e9sentera \u00ab Petit Soleil \u00bb, un album \u00e9crit principalement en fran\u00e7ais qui puise dans les rythmes traditionnels du Nordeste du Br\u00e9sil pour nous parler du cycle de la vie \u00e0 travers des histoires, contes, l\u00e9gendes, po\u00e8mes qui, du lever au couch\u00e9 du soleil, s\u2019enchev\u00eatrent les unes aux autres et se font \u00e9cho comme des souvenirs coll\u00e9s les uns aux autres dans un album de famille. Amorosa est groupe unique qui m\u00e9lange les genres et emm\u00e8ne le public dans un univers tant\u00f4t intime, festif ou contemplatif nous invitant \u00e0 l\u2019introspection comme \u00e0 c\u00e9l\u00e9brer la joie et faire partir les peines. La musique d\u2019Amorosa est g\u00e9n\u00e9reuse, \u00e0 la fois simple, \u00e9l\u00e9gante et riche et tire sa singularit\u00e9 et sa modernit\u00e9 de sa fa\u00e7on de m\u00e9langer les genres, les textures, les registres tout en puisant dans les traditions populaires. Les musiciens ont tous v\u00e9cu, voyag\u00e9 ou \u00e9tudi\u00e9s au Br\u00e9sil et puisent dans les racines musicales de ce pays pour dialoguer avec le jazz, la po\u00e9sie et la langue fran\u00e7aise et cr\u00e9er une musique hybride, m\u00e9tiss\u00e9e \u00e0 la fois puissante, raffin\u00e9e et pleine de libert\u00e9. Sur sc\u00e8ne le groupe est solaire, il \u00ab n\u2019h\u00e9site pas \u00e0 m\u00e9langer les rythmes, \u00e0 m\u00e9langer les couleurs, \u00e0 oser les chemins moins balis\u00e9s\u2026 et dans cet univers presque onirique, un peu douillet et cotonneux, ce Petit Soleil est tout simplement un grand bonheur\u00bb (Jacques Prouvot pour la revue Jazzques). \u00ab L\u2019amour a ses raisons que la raison ignore \u00bb dit le dicton \u2026 Aussi, vouloir classer la musique d\u2019Amorosa dans une case serait passer \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de sa richesse, de sa joie, de sa douceur et de sa folie et se priver du voyage chaque fois diff\u00e9rent \u00e0 travers lequel le groupe propose sur sc\u00e8ne. ","performers":"St\u00e9phanie Scultore : chant, textes, compositions \n\nMatteo Carola : guitare, cavaquinho, chant, compositions \nMathieu Robert : saxophone soprano, fl\u00fbte shakhuachi, agog\u00f4, choeur \nFil Caporali : contrebasse, choeur \nFalk Shrauwen : percussions ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"sp":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"},"nl":{"name":"Petit soleil","shortdescr":"AMOROSA is een multiculturele muziekgroep uit Brussel, gedreven door een stem die de liefde bezingt in het Frans en Portugees en ons meesleept in haar po\u00ebzie, tussen de warmte van Braziliaanse ritmes en de elegantie van jazzharmonie\u00ebn. De stem is die van singer-songwriter St\u00e9phanie Scultore.","longdescr":"Na Chorando Sim, een debuutalbum met sambasmaak, en het kinderproject Gato, presenteert AMOROSA Petit Soleil, een voornamelijk in het Frans geschreven album dat put uit de traditionele ritmes van Noordoost-Brazili\u00eb om ons te vertellen over de cyclus van het leven aan de hand van verhalen, vertellingen, legendes en gedichten die, van zonsopgang tot zonsondergang, door elkaar heen lopen en elkaar echo\u00ebn als herinneringen die in een familiealbum zijn geplakt. Amorosa is een unieke groep die genres mengt en het publiek meeneemt naar een universum dat soms intiem, feestelijk of contemplatief is, en ons uitnodigt tot introspectie, om vreugde te vieren en verdriet los te laten. De muziek van Amorosa is genereus, eenvoudig, elegant en rijk, en het haalt zijn unieke en moderne karakter uit de manier waarop het genres, texturen en registers mengt terwijl het put uit populaire tradities. De muzikanten hebben allemaal in Brazili\u00eb gewoond, gereisd of gestudeerd en putten uit de muzikale wortels van het land om een dialoog te cre\u00ebren met jazz, po\u00ebzie en de Franse taal, waardoor een hybride muziek ontstaat die krachtig, verfijnd en vol vrijheid is. \nOp het podium is de groep vol zonneschijn, \u201cniet aarzelend om ritmes te mengen, om kleuren te mengen, om minder platgetreden paden te durven bewandelen... en in dit bijna droomachtige universum, een beetje knus en katoenachtig, is Petit Soleil gewoonweg een groot plezier\u201d (Jacques Prouvot voor Jazzques magazine). \u201cLiefde heeft haar redenen die de rede negeert\u201d luidt het gezegde... Dus om te proberen de muziek van Amorosa in een hokje te plaatsen zou zijn om de rijkdom, de vreugde, de lieflijkheid en de waanzin ervan te missen, en om de steeds veranderende reis te missen waarop de groep ons meeneemt. \n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005027"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39109,"location":{"lat":50.86391031,"lon":4.34697026},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-30T15:45:30+02:00","published_at":"2