6","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"pt":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"en":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":"Val\u00e8re Burnon, a young Belgian candidate for the Queen Elisabeth Piano Competition 2025\nBorn in 1998, Val\u00e8re Burnon is a promising Belgian pianist.\n","longdescr":"He is the first prizewinner of the prestigious \u00c9pinal International Piano Competition in 2019 and the Bremen European Piano Competition in 2021, the Revelation Prize at the Long-Thibaud Competition in Paris in 2022 and the second prizewinner at the Viotti Competition in Vercelli in 2023,\nHe is the first prizewinner of the prestigious \u00c9pinal International Piano Competition in 2019 and the Bremen European Piano Competition in 2021, the Revelation Prize at the Long-Thibaud Competition in Paris in 2022 and the second prizewinner at the Viotti Competition in Vercelli in 2023, he has more and more opportunities to share his passion on European stages, whether as a soloist, a chamber musician or with renowned orchestras such as the Orchestre Royal de Chambre de Wallonie, the Sinfonia Varsovia or the Milan Symphony Orchestra \u266a \nHe has also released two CDs. After ten years studying with Marie-Paule Cornia, notably at the Conservatoire Royal de Li\u00e8ge, he went on to study at the Hochschule f\u00fcr Musik und Tanz K\u00f6ln with Florence Millet, and is currently continuing his training at the Accademia Pianistica \u2018Incontri col Maestro\u2019 in Imola with Leonid Margarius and at the Chapelle Musicale Reine \u00c9lisabeth with Frank Braley \nVal\u00e8re also attends numerous masterclasses throughout Europe with eminent pianists, in particular Jean-Claude vanden Eynden, Jean-Bernard Pommier and Bertrand Chamayou.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"it":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"cn":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"fr":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":"Val\u00e8re Burnon, un jeune marchois candidat au concours Reine Elisabeth piano 2025\nN\u00e9 en 1998, Val\u00e8re Burnon est un pianiste belge au talent prometteur\nEntre autres premier laur\u00e9at des prestigieux Concours International de Piano d\u2019\u00c9pinal en 2019 et Concours Europ\u00e9en de Br\u00eame en 2021, Prix R\u00e9v\u00e9lation du Concours Long-Thibaud \u00e0 Paris en 2022 et second laur\u00e9at du Concours Viotti \u00e0 Vercelli en 2023, ","longdescr":"il a de plus en plus l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de partager sa passion sur les sc\u00e8nes europ\u00e9ennes, que ce soit en solo, en tant que chambriste ou en compagnie d\u2019orchestres renomm\u00e9s tels que l\u2019Orchestre Royal de Chambre de Wallonie, le Sinfonia Varsovia ou l\u2019Orchestre Symphonique de Milan \u266a \n\nIl a \u00e9galement sorti deux CD. Apr\u00e8s dix ans pass\u00e9s \u00e0 \u00e9tudier aupr\u00e8s de Marie-Paule Cornia, notamment au Conservatoire Royal de Li\u00e8ge, il a \u00e9tudi\u00e9 \u00e0 la Hochschule f\u00fcr Musik und Tanz K\u00f6ln aupr\u00e8s de Florence Millet et poursuit actuellement sa formation \u00e0 l\u2019Accademia Pianistica \u00ab Incontri col Maestro \u00bb \u00e0 Imola aupr\u00e8s de Leonid Margarius ainsi qu\u2019\u00e0 la Chapelle Musicale Reine \u00c9lisabeth aupr\u00e8s de Frank Braley \n\nVal\u00e8re assiste \u00e9galement de nombreuses masterclasses \u00e0 travers l\u2019Europre aupr\u00e8s d\u2019\u00e9minents pianistes, et plus particul\u00e8rement avec Jean-Claude vanden Eynden, Jean-Bernard Pommier et Bertrand Chamayou\nVG. Faur\u00e9, L. van Beethoven, F. Chopin, F. Liszt, S. Lyapunov, F. Liszt \n\n","performers":"Val\u00e8re Burnon","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"sp":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"},"nl":{"name":"Solo Piano- Val\u00e8re Burnon","shortdescr":"Val\u00e8re Burnon, een jonge Belgische kandidaat voor de Koningin Elisabethwedstrijd voor piano 2025\nVal\u00e8re Burnon, geboren in 1998, is een veelbelovende Belgische pianist.\n","longdescr":"Hij is de eerste prijswinnaar van de prestigieuze \u00c9pinal International Piano Competition in 2019 en de Bremen European Piano Competition in 2021, de Revelation Prize van de Long-Thibaud Competition in Parijs in 2022 en de tweede prijswinnaar van de Viotti Competition in Vercelli in 2023\nHij is de eerste prijswinnaar van de prestigieuze \u00c9pinal International Piano Competition in 2019 en de Bremen European Piano Competition in 2021, de Revelation Prize van de Long-Thibaud Competition in Parijs in 2022 en de tweede prijswinnaar van de Viotti Competition in Vercelli in 2023, krijgt hij steeds meer kansen om zijn passie te delen op Europese podia, als solist, als kamermusicus of met gerenommeerde orkesten zoals het Orchestre Royal de Chambre de Wallonie, het Sinfonia Varsovia of het Milan Symphony Orchestra \u266a \nHij heeft ook twee cd's uitgebracht. Na tien jaar studeren bij Marie-Paule Cornia, met name aan het Conservatoire Royal de Li\u00e8ge, ging hij verder studeren aan de Hochschule f\u00fcr Musik und Tanz K\u00f6ln bij Florence Millet, en momenteel vervolgt hij zijn opleiding aan de Accademia Pianistica \u201cIncontri col Maestro\u201d in Imola bij Leonid Margarius en aan de Chapelle Musicale Reine \u00c9lisabeth bij Frank Braley \nVal\u00e8re volgt ook talrijke masterclasses in heel Europa bij eminente pianisten, met name Jean-Claude vanden Eynden, Jean-Bernard Pommier en Bertrand Chamayou.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005028"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"ema