,"pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[6,4],"translations":{"de":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Worldmusic, Folk e Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Worldmusic, folk y country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"pt":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"en":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":"The Arsys Collective was formed in 2013 around a shared passion for chamber music. This ensemble is driven by the desire to explore and showcase original and eclectic repertoires. Its members come from Belgian military orchestras and\/or teach at conservatories.\n","longdescr":"Its members come from Belgian military bands and\/or teach at conservatories. In 2017, they released the album \u2018\u2019Tango Sensations\u2018\u2019, the fruit of a collaboration with Belgian accordionist and bandoneonist Daniel Gruselle, based on Astor Piazzolla's eponymous work. A few years later, building on this experience, they set about exploring the Klezmer tradition with clarinettist Nicolas Cr\u00e9tu and created the Dreams & Prayers programme. Driven by a desire to create and enrich its repertoire, the Collectif has also worked with many composers on the contemporary scene: Gwena\u00ebl Grisi, Gerardo Jerez Le Cam, Alejandro Shwartz, Nicolas Bacri, Frederik Neyrinck and others. In regular collaboration with Chamber Music for Europe, Collectif Arsys was invited in 2017 to the Chir\u00e9-en-Montreuil and Cramard Festivals, as well as to the \u2018\u2019Concerts en nos Villages\u2018\u2019 Festival in France. The ensemble will also be touring with the Festival de Wallonie in 2018. It has performed in such renowned venues as Bozar, the Triangel in St. Vith, the Espace Senghor, Flagey, Amuz, the Palais des Beaux-Arts in Charleroi, etc\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/2PibPFCQOobDQMck9Ld9ir?si=QlsKYKhiSxeNp_8-iId1wQ\nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/collectifsaxophonesarsys\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/collectifarsys\/ \nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@collectifarsys8326","performers":"Nicolas Cretu - Clarinet Collectif Arsys : Paul-Hugo Chartier - Soprano saxophone Gema Fernandez Ar\u00e9valo - Alto saxophone Kristof Kerremans - Tenor saxophone J\u00e9r\u00e9mie David - Baritone saxophone, vocals, arrangements \n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"it":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"cn":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"fr":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":"C'est autour d'une passion commune pour la musique de chambre que se cr\u00e9e en 2013 le Collectif Arsys. Cet ensemble est anim\u00e9 par l'envie d'explorer et de mettre en valeur des r\u00e9pertoires originaux et \u00e9clectiques. Ses membres sont issus d'orchestres militaires belges et\/ou enseignants en conservatoires.","longdescr":"Ses membres sont issus d'orchestres militaires belges et\/ou enseignants en conservatoires. En 2017, sort l'album ''Tango Sensations'', fruit d'une collaboration avec l'accord\u00e9oniste et bandon\u00e9oniste belge Daniel Gruselle, autour de l\u2019oeuvre \u00e9ponyme d'Astor Piazzolla. Quelques ann\u00e9es apr\u00e8s, et forts de cette exp\u00e9rience, ils s'attellent \u00e0 explorer la tradition Klezmer avec le clarinettiste Nicolas Cr\u00e9tu et cr\u00e9ent le programme Dreams & Prayers. Anim\u00e9 par la volont\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er et d'enrichir son r\u00e9pertoire, le Collectif a \u00e9galement travaill\u00e9 avec de nombreux compositeurs de la sc\u00e8ne contemporaine : Gwena\u00ebl Grisi, Gerardo Jerez Le Cam, Alejandro Shwartz, Nicolas Bacri, Frederik Neyrinck etc. En collaboration r\u00e9guli\u00e8re aupr\u00e8s de Chamber Music for Europe, le Collectif Arsys est invit\u00e9 en 2017 au Festival de Chir\u00e9-en-Montreuil et de Cramard, ainsi qu'au Festival ''Concerts en nos Villages'' en France. L'ensemble participe \u00e9galement \u00e0 la tourn\u00e9e du Festival de Wallonie en 2018. Il a eu l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de se produire dans des salles de renomm\u00e9e telles que Bozar, le Triangel \u00e0 St. Vith, l\u2019Espace Senghor, Flagey, Amuz, le Palais des Beaux-Arts de Charleroi, etc.\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/2PibPFCQOobDQMck9Ld9ir?si=QlsKYKhiSxeNp_8-iId1wQ\nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/collectifsaxophonesarsys\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/collectifarsys\/ \nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@collectifarsys8326","performers":"Nicolas Cretu - Clarinette Collectif Arsys : Paul-Hugo Chartier - Saxophone soprano Gema Fernandez Ar\u00e9valo - Saxophone alto Kristof Kerremans - Saxophone t\u00e9nor J\u00e9r\u00e9mie David - Saxophone baryton, chant, arrangements \n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"sp":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"},"nl":{"name":"Dreams & Prayers","shortdescr":"Het Arsys Collectief werd in 2013 gevormd rond een gedeelde passie voor kamermuziek. Dit ensemble wordt gedreven door de wens om originele en eclectische repertoires te verkennen en te laten horen. De leden komen uit Belgische militaire orkesten en\/of geven les aan conservatoria.\n","longdescr":"De leden komen uit Belgische militaire bands en\/of geven les aan conservatoria. In 2017 brachten ze het album \u201cTango Sensations\u201d uit, het resultaat van een samenwerking met de Belgische accordeonist en bandoneonist Daniel Gruselle, gebaseerd op het gelijknamige werk van Astor Piazzolla. Voortbouwend op deze ervaring gingen ze enkele jaren later de Klezmertraditie verkennen met klarinettist Nicolas Cr\u00e9tu en cre\u00eberden ze het programma Dreams & Prayers. Gedreven door het verlangen om zijn repertoire te cre\u00ebren en te verrijken, heeft het Collectif ook samengewerkt met vele componisten van de hedendaagse scene: Gwena\u00ebl Grisi, Gerardo Jerez Le Cam, Alejandro Shwartz, Nicolas Bacri, Frederik Neyrinck en anderen. In regelmatige samenwerking met Chamber Music for Europe werd Collectif Arsys in 2017 uitgenodigd voor de Festivals van Chir\u00e9-en-Montreuil en Cramard, evenals voor het Festival ''Concerts en nos Villages'' in Frankrijk. Het ensemble neemt ook deel aan de Festival de Wallonie tour in 2018. Het heeft opgetreden in gerenommeerde zalen als Bozar, de Triangel in St. Vith, de Espace Senghor, Flagey, Amuz, het Palais des Beaux-Arts in Charleroi, enz.\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/2PibPFCQOobDQMck9Ld9ir?si=QlsKYKhiSxeNp_8-iId1wQ\nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/collectifsaxophonesarsys\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/collectifarsys\/ \nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@collectifarsys8326\n","performers":"Nicolas Cretu - Klarinet Collectif Arsys : Paul-Hugo Chartier - Sopraansaxofoon Gema Fernandez Ar\u00e9valo - Altsaxofoon Kristof Kerremans - Tenorsaxofoon J\u00e9r\u00e9mie David - Baritonsaxofoon, zang, arrangementen \n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005030"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39109,"location":{"lat":50.86391031,"lon":4.34697026},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-30T15:45:30+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-15T20:19:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.co