orporating their own compositions into their repertoire. On the menu: an invitation to dance and travel, to enjoy a moment of introspection supported by, at times, a guitar and a violin and, at others, a bouzouki and a guitar. And, of course, two voices. At the start of this year, they present their very first album.\nA must-see!\n","performers":"Nomino\u00eb Crawford - Violin, Guitar and vocals, Massimiliano Engelli - Guitar, Bouzouki, Vocals\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"},"it":{"name":"NoMa duo, Greek Music","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"},"cn":{"name":"NoMa duo, Greek Music","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"},"fr":{"name":"NoMa duo, Greek Music","shortdescr":"NoMa est le fruit d\u00e9licieusement m\u00fbr de la rencontre entre les chanteurs et multi-instrumentistes Nomino\u00eb Crawford et Massimiliano Engelli.","longdescr":"Tout a d\u00e9marr\u00e9 autour de leur passion commune pour la Gr\u00e8ce et sa culture, de laquelle ils proposent un r\u00e9pertoire m\u00eal\u00e9 de Rembetiko, Nisiotiko, Mikrasiatiko et Paradosiako. Au fur \u00e0 mesure, NoMa commence \u00e0 proposer ses propres arrangements, jusqu'\u00e0 int\u00e9grer dans leur r\u00e9pertoire leurs compositions. Au menu : une invitation \u00e0 la danse et au voyage, \u00e0 profiter d'un instant d'introspection soutenue par, tant\u00f4t, une guitare et un violon et, tant\u00f4t, un bouzouki et une guitare. Et bien s\u00fbr deux voix. En ce d\u00e9but d'ann\u00e9e, ils pr\u00e9sentent leur tout premier album.\nA d\u00e9couvrir absolument !","performers":"Nomino\u00eb Crawford - Violon, Guitare et voix, Massimiliano Engelli - Guitare, Bouzouki, Voix","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"},"sp":{"name":"NoMa duo, Greek Music","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"},"nl":{"name":"NoMa duo, Greek Music","shortdescr":"Noma is ontstaan uit een ontmoeting tussen de twee zangers en multi-instrumentalisten Massimiliano Engelli en Nomino\u00eb Crawford. Het begin van een mooi verhaal.\n","longdescr":"Vertrekkend vanuit een gedeelde passie voor de Griekse cultuur, stellen ze een repertoire samen waarin ze stukken uit Rebetiko, Nisiotiko, Mikrasiatiko en Paradosiako spelen. Stukje bij beetje ontwikkelen ze hun eigen muziek, waarin Turkse en Griekse invloeden zich mengen met hun persoonlijke kleuren en noten. De composities worden gekenmerkt door tweestemmige zang, afwisseling tussen viool en gitaar of bouzouki en gitaar, en teksten die geschreven zijn in samenwerking met Turkse en Griekse dichters.","performers":"Nomino\u00eb Crawford - viool, gitaar en zang, Massimiliano Engelli - gitaar, bouzouki, zang\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005031"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtu