\u00e9rents univers et langues !\n\n\u00c0 21h30, les com\u00e9diens professionnels de 'Babel Games' vous pr\u00e9senteront un spectacle in\u00e9dit m\u00ealant jeux improvis\u00e9s, langage, gestes et \u00e9motions, illustrant une compr\u00e9hension qui va au-del\u00e0 des mots.\n\nPas besoin d'\u00eatre polyglotte ! Ces spectacles nous rappellent qu'au-del\u00e0 des langues que nous parlons, nous avons tous la capacit\u00e9 de nous comprendre !","performers":"Premier spectacle: Participants des ateliers d'improvisation multilingue \"Improvyglot\"\nDeuxi\u00e8me spectacle: Les com\u00e9diens professionnels du spectacle \"Babel Games\" : Laurie Andrieu, Dan Gelbard, Billy Kissa et Khalid Benaouisse","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/forms.gle\/hXTXjAeufcU6rvpq9","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004682"},"sp":{"name":"Soir\u00e9e d'improvisation multilingue","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/forms.gle\/hXTXjAeufcU6rvpq9","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004682"},"nl":{"name":"Soir\u00e9e d'improvisation multilingue","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/forms.gle\/hXTXjAeufcU6rvpq9","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004682"}},"place":{"id":50002363,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Maison des Cultures de Saint-Gilles","address_street_name":"Rue de Belgrade","address_street_number":"120","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de Belgrade, 120","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":n