il":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"pt":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"en":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":"This Saturday, January 25, MA. ART SPACE opens its doors to you for an unprecedented immersion into the world of the Japanese concept of \u9593 (MA). On the program, a captivating lecture by Adina Mazzoni-Cernus and a koto and shamisen concert by Aki Sato, all sublimated by an exhibition by artist Michel Mazzoni. An evening to explore this unique notion of space and temporality. ","longdescr":"What is the \u9593? \n\nThe MA \u9593 is a Japanese concept that embodies the space or interval between objects and events, playing on spatial and temporal dimensions. In Japanese culture, MA is essential in aesthetics, architecture, music or calligraphy: it embodies the silence between two notes, the fluidity of spaces, and visual rhythm. MA is both what separates and what unites.\n\nExhibition by Michel Mazzoni | 16h00 > 18h00 | free admission\nOn view from January 25 to February 9\n\nArtist Michel Mazzoni reinterprets the aesthetics of the MA in a contemporary context. Through his images, he captures spaces, light variations and details, offering a striking illustration of the MA philosophy.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"it":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"cn":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"fr":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":"Ce samedi 25 janvier, le MA. ART SPACE vous ouvre ses portes pour une immersion in\u00e9dite dans l\u2019univers du concept japonais du \u9593 (MA). Au programme, une conf\u00e9rence captivante d\u2019Adina Mazzoni-Cernus et un concert au koto et au shamisen par Aki Sato, le tout sublim\u00e9 par une exposition de l\u2019artiste Michel Mazzoni. Une soir\u00e9e pour explorer cette notion unique d\u2019espace et de temporalit\u00e9. \n\n","longdescr":"Qu\u2019est-ce que le \u9593 ? \n\nLe MA \u9593 est un concept japonais qui incarne l\u2019espace ou l\u2019intervalle entre les objets et les \u00e9v\u00e9nements, jouant sur les dimensions spatiales et temporelles. Dans la culture japonaise, le MA est essentiel en esth\u00e9tique, en architecture, en musique ou en calligraphie : il incarne le silence entre deux notes, la fluidit\u00e9 des espaces, et le rythme visuel. Le MA est \u00e0 la fois ce qui s\u00e9pare et ce qui unit.\n\nAU PROGRAMME :\n\nVernissage de Michel Mazzoni | 16h00 > 18h00 | entr\u00e9e libre\n\u00c0 visiter du 25 janvier au 9 f\u00e9vrier\n\nL\u2019artiste Michel Mazzoni propose une r\u00e9interpr\u00e9tation de l\u2019esth\u00e9tique du MA dans une temporalit\u00e9 contemporaine. \u00c0 travers ses images, il capte des espaces, des variations de lumi\u00e8re et des d\u00e9tails, offrant ainsi une illustration saisissante de la philosophie du MA.\n\nD\u00e9couvrez \u00e9galement la conf\u00e9rence et le concert de l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement, de 18h \u00e0 20h : uniquement sur r\u00e9servation !","performers":"Michel Mazzoni","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"sp":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"},"nl":{"name":"Michel Mazzoni : Immersion dans le concept japonais du \u9593","shortdescr":"Aanstaande zaterdag 25 januari opent de MA. ART SPACE haar deuren voor u open voor een ongekende onderdompeling in de wereld van het Japanse concept van \u9593. Op het programma staan een boeiende lezing van Adina Mazzoni-Cernus en een koto- en shamisenconcert van Aki Sato, aangevuld met een tentoonstelling van kunstenaar Michel Mazzoni. Een avond om deze unieke notie van ruimte en tijd te verkennen. ","longdescr":"Wat is de MA \u9593? \n\nDe MA \u9593 is een Japans concept dat de ruimte of het interval tussen objecten en gebeurtenissen belichaamt, spelend met ruimtelijke en temporele dimensies. In de Japanse cultuur is de MA essentieel in esthetiek, architectuur, muziek of kalligrafie: het belichaamt de stilte tussen twee noten, de vloeibaarheid van ruimtes en visueel ritme. De AM is zowel wat scheidt als wat verenigt.\n\nTentoonstelling door Michel Mazzoni | 16h00 > 18h00 | gratis toegang\nTe zien van 25 januari tot 9 februari\n\nKunstenaar Michel Mazzoni herinterpreteert de esthetiek van de MA in een hedendaagse context. In zijn beelden legt hij ruimtes, variaties in licht en details vast en geeft zo een treffende illustratie van de MA-filosofie.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004183"}},"place":{"id":50001409,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ma. Art Space","address_street_name":"Rue de la Victoire","address_street_number":"102","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ma-artspace.com","website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de la Victoire, 102","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Ma. Art Space","address_street_name":"Rue de la Victoire","address_street_number":"102","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ma-artspace.com","website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de la Victoire, 102","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Ma. Art Space","address_street_name":"Overwinningsstraat","address_street_number":"102","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ma-artspace.com","website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41