"fr":["Musique Contemporaine"],"sp":["M\u00fasica contempor\u00e1nea"],"nl":["Hedendaagse Muziek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"pt":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"en":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u201cQuidquid sub terra est, in apricum proferet aetas\u201d (\u201cEverything, which lies beneath the earth, time will bring to light\u201d)\n\n\u201cNothing looks the way it sounds. And nothing sounds the way it looks.\u201d (Christina Kubisch, Hidden Resonances)\n\nWhat goes on underground? When we listen beneath the surface, what kind of sounds arise to our ears? Which roots, presences and networks do we find?\n\nLa Semaine du Son \/ De Week van de Klank 2025 will take place from 26 January until 2 February in Brussels, and from 3 February to 9 February in Flandres and Wallonia. The festival\u2019s next edition revolves around the theme of Sub Terra and will present various concerts, performances, lectures, installations, sound walks, discussions, workshops,\u2026 Reservations will be open from 6 January 2025.\n\nMay the unseen trigger our imagination and receptivity, and let\u2019s find a common meeting ground for new exchanges and encounters!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/en\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"it":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"cn":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"fr":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00ab Quidquid sub terra est, in apricum proferet aetas \u00bb (\u00ab Tout ce qui se trouve sous la terre, le temps le mettra en lumi\u00e8re \u00bb)\n\n\u201cNothing looks the way it sounds. And nothing sounds the way it looks.\u201d (Christina Kubisch, Hidden Resonances)\n\nQue se passe-t-il sous terre, en souterrain ? Lorsque nous \u00e9coutons sous la surface, quels types de sons nous parviennent \u00e0 l\u2019oreille ? Quelles racines, pr\u00e9sences et r\u00e9seaux y trouve-t-on ? \n\nLa Semaine du Son 2025 aura lieu du 26 janvier au 2 f\u00e9vrier \u00e0 Bruxelles, et du 3 au 9 f\u00e9vrier 2025 en Flandre et en Wallonie. Elle aura pour th\u00e8me Sub Terra et propose un programme de concerts, performances, pr\u00e9sentations, installations, balades sonores, discussions, ateliers et plus encore. Les r\u00e9servations seront ouvertes \u00e0 partir du 6 janvier 2025.\n\nQue l\u2019invisible stimule notre imagination et notre r\u00e9ceptivit\u00e9. Cr\u00e9ons ensemble un espace de rencontres et d\u2019\u00e9changes !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"sp":{"name":"La Semaine du Son 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"},"nl":{"name":"De Week van de Klank 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u201cQuidquid sub terra est, in apricum proferet aetas\u201d (\u201cAlles, wat onder de aarde ligt, zal de tijd aan het licht brengen\u201d)\n\n\u201cNothing looks the way it sounds. And nothing sounds the way it looks.\u201d (Christina Kubisch, Hidden Resonances)\n\nWat gebeurt er ondergronds? Welke wortels, aanwezigheden en netwerken vinden we daar terug? Wat horen we wanneer we door de oppervlakte heen luisteren?\n\nDe Week van de Klank 2025 zal plaatsvinden van 26 januari t.e.m. 2 februari in Brussel, en van 3 t.e.m. 9 februari 2025 in Vlaanderen en Walloni\u00eb. Het thema voor de volgende editie is\nSub Terra en er staan opnieuw een heel aantal concerten, performances, presentaties, installaties, klankwandelingen, discussies, workshops,\u2026 op het programma! Reservaties zijn mogelijk vanaf 6 januari 2025.\n\nMoge het onzichtbare onze verbeelding en ontvankelijkheid aanwakkeren; laten we samen een gedeelde grond voor uitwisseling en ontmoeting cre\u00ebren!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lasemaineduson.be\/nl\/","email":"info@lasemaineduson.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004820"}},"place":{"id":245448,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Divers lieux \u00e0 Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Divers lieux \u00e0 Bruxelle