s formant un ensemble \u00e9quilibr\u00e9, nos chambres repr\u00e9sentent un sanctuaire luxueux en plein centre de la ville.\nFood and Drinks at The Dominican\nLes volumineux plafonds, les hautes fen\u00eatres, l\u2019\u00e9clairage naturel et l\u2019ouvrage m\u00e9tallique admirablement cisel\u00e9 font du Grand Lounge un cadre \u00e9l\u00e9gant, id\u00e9al pour un repas romantique ou une r\u00e9union professionnelle. Notre menu cr\u00e9atif et notre vaste carte de boissons r\u00e9pondront \u00e0 tous les go\u00fbts. Par temps chaud, nos invit\u00e9s peuvent profiter d\u2019un d\u00eener \u00ab al fresco \u00bb dans la cour centrale.\nLe Lounge Bar de l\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican allie parfaitement l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re traditionnelle d\u2019un caf\u00e9 et le confort douillet d\u2019un salon \u00e9l\u00e9gant. Au Lounge Bar, vous trouverez un design int\u00e9rieur sophistiqu\u00e9, des boissons inventives et un menu \u00e0 la carte.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"The Dominican","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"The Dominican, da